[trp_sod_strategy_advisor, "sa_select_commoners2", [], "My opinion is that while they are no organized guild, if you find them during your travels, hire them directly under your command and treat them as you would any mercenary.  If you stumble across a commoner jobless party in battle and in need of help, save their asses.  In time they will grow devoted, and do the same for you when they spot you in riding distance.", "sa_select_commoners3", []],
